   "shape": "hand-authored",
   "label": "f04-rounding-policy",
   "front": "What rounding policy does PayrollService.Calculate apply, and why should it be written down?",
   "back": "Each payroll item is rounded to 2 decimal places, then the run totals are sums of the rounded items, so totals equal the lines a worker sees. That is defensible, but it should be a comment or a test; rounding totals independently is how invoices end up a cent off.",
